* Elimination of a disjoint union with a one-element right summand: an element that is not ` none ` is ` some ` of its second projection, and that projection lies in the left summand.  This is what turns Lean's ` match t r with | some W => ... ` into ` ( 2nd ` ( t ` r ) ) ` in ~ df-dpgos and ~ df-extractgos .

